OL,3,GNEWSACoastal wildfire believed to be
OL,4,Aset deliberately
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews who tackled a coastal
OL,7,Fwildfire believe it was started
OL,8,Fdeliberately.
OL,10,FCrews in fire engines along with
OL,11,Foff-road vehicles and water carriers
OL,12,Fwere called to the fire near near
OL,13,FStokes Bay off Crescent Road in
OL,14,FGosport, Hampshire, at about 13:30 BST
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FWith thick smoke from the fire,
OL,18,Finvolving gorse, trees and grassland,
OL,19,Fnearby roads were closed and residents
OL,20,Fwere advised to avoid the area and keep
OL,21,Fdoors and windows closed.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
